#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""VPN Manager for Throne on Debian/Linux.

Session policy:
- A session is pinned to one static Throne profile.
- Candidate retries are allowed only before any profile has reached RUNNING.
- Once a profile is observed RUNNING, no other profile is ever connected by this program.
- Auto Selector profiles are never used because they can switch exit servers during work.
- Stop disconnects Throne, turns TUN and system proxy off, disables Kill Switch last,
  and restores the original system timezone.
"""
